It is possible to trigger any command by dispatching a [RunCommandMessage](https://github.com/symfony/symfony/blob/8.1/src/Symfony/Component/Console/Messenger/RunCommandMessage.php) . Symfony

will take care of handling this message and execute the command passed

to the message parameter:

```
