The component contains two main classes called [Filesystem](https://github.com/symfony/symfony/blob/8.1/src/Symfony/Component/Filesystem/Filesystem.php) and [Path](https://github.com/symfony/symfony/blob/8.1/src/Symfony/Component/Filesystem/Path.php) :

```
use Symfony \ Component \ Filesystem \ Exception \ IOExceptionInterface ; use Symfony \ Component \ Filesystem \ Filesystem ; use Symfony \ Component \ Filesystem \ Path ; $ filesystem = new Filesystem (); try { $ filesystem -> mkdir (
        Path:: normalize ( sys_get_temp_dir (). '/' . random_int ( 0 , 1000 )),
    );
} catch (IOExceptionInterface $ exception ) { echo "An error occurred while creating your directory at " . $ exception -> getPath ();
}
