`400 Bad Request` response is returned. You can customize this

status code with the

`validationFailedStatusCode` option:

```
use Symfony \ Component \ HttpFoundation \ Response ; use Symfony \ Component \ HttpKernel \ Attribute \ MapRequestHeader ; // ...
public function dashboard ( #[MapRequestHeader( validationFailedStatusCode : Response:: HTTP_UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY )] string $ accept ,
) : Response { // ... }
