## [Getting Services from the Service Container](#getting-services-from-the-service-container)

To actually create a new user, the command has to access some [services](service_container.html) . Since your command is already registered

as a service, you can use normal dependency injection. Imagine you have a

`App\Service\UserManager` service that you want to access:

```
// ...
