### [The SentMessageEvent Event](#the-sentmessageevent-event)

**Typical Purposes** : To perform some action when the message is successfully

sent (like retrieve the id returned when the message is sent).

After the message has been successfully sent, the event class `SentMessageEvent` is dispatched. Listeners receive a [SentMessageEvent](https://github.com/symfony/symfony/blob/8.1/src/Symfony/Component/Notifier/Event/SentMessageEvent.php) event:

```
use Symfony \ Component \ Notifier \ Event \ SentMessageEvent ; $ dispatcher -> addListener (SentMessageEvent:: class , function (SentMessageEvent $ event ) : void { // gets the message instance $ message = $ event -> getMessage (); // log something $ this -> logger ( sprintf ( 'The message has been successfully sent and has id: %s' , $ message -> getMessageId ()));
});
```

